 :holes
 [{:edge [:R6 :R16] :equation :action :status :path-dependent
   :finding "In the WM judge + close-loop! path, close-loop! enacts the first passing act gate from ranked actions, not the recorded Q(π) selection (C448). In the production runner, selected-entry resolves the decision's action to its ranked entry and enacts it (C452: full_loop_runner.clj:870-873). Whether the two paths agree on the enacted action is the open question."
   :evidence "war_machine.clj:4573-4584, 4804-4817; enact.clj:287-316; full_loop_runner.clj:870-873"}
  {:edges [[:R2 :R17] [:R1 :R17]] :equation :dirichlet-accumulation :status :not-realised
   :finding "Da Costa eq. 21 accumulates Dirichlet concentrations from observed (o, s) pairs. The WM's a4a accumulates a capability x mission model from substrate hyperedges and discharges instead; no path from the tick model's o or μ into R17 was found."
   :evidence "a4a.clj:85-113; a4a_substrate.clj:46-60; grep trace -> 0 hits in a4a.clj, a4a_substrate.clj, r17_offline.clj"}
  {:symbol :F :status :no-consumer
   :finding "Per-tick F is computed and stored and read by nothing (C448, C452). This is NOT a theory hole: BMR does not import F (see :model-reduction). It is an observation about the F row: a diagnostic."
   :evidence "war_machine.clj:4450-4452, 4753"}]

